<title>NORWAY: Orkla 4-mnth result by division.</title>
<headline>Orkla 4-mnth result by division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to April 30, operating results by area of activity:</p>
<p>				   (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> -Beverages			   73	vs	45</p>
<p> -Food				 140	vs     134</p>
<p> -Brands			     123	vs     105</p>
<p> -Media				 69	vs	59</p>
<p> -Total branded consumer goods 405	vs	343</p>
<p> -Chemicals			   79	vs	153</p>
<p> -Unallocated			-47	vs	-23</p>
<p> -Other revenue, costs	   158	vs	 20</p>
<p> -Total industry		   595	vs	493</p>
<p> -Investments			 38	vs	 21</p>
<p> Total operating result	  633	vs	514</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
